{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"HowToMakeMoneyOnSnapchat.com API","version":"1.0.0","summary":"Verified, sourced Snapchat creator-monetization rules and deterministic published-criteria, gap, and growth-pace calculations for AI agents.","description":"Independent; not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Snap Inc.\n\n**Independent third party. Not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Snap Inc. Snapchat is a trademark of Snap Inc.**\n\nEvery response keeps three things apart:\n- FACT: what Snap's official pages say, with source URL, `verified_at`, `effective_date` and `status` (current | historical | unverified).\n- CALCULATION: math we did, with the inputs and formula shown.\n- RECOMMENDATION: our suggestion, labeled as ours, with its assumptions and risks.\n\ncheck_eligibility never returns an \"eligible\" verdict. It returns `published_criteria_status` (meets_published_criteria | does_not_meet_published_criteria | unknown) together with a fixed `disclaimer` saying that invitation to the Monetization Program is at Snap's discretion.\n\nEntry vs ongoing: by default the calculation tools evaluate only entry (invitation) requirements. Ongoing requirements for creators already in the program, such as 100 hours of Spotlight view time over 28 days to qualify for maximum Creator Rewards, are reported in a separate section, and only when `already_enrolled: true`.\n\nScope: by default the tools serve the MVP programs: the Unified Monetization Program, its payouts and tax, Snap Star as a prerequisite, content and recommendation policy, and brand partnerships as FACTs. Out-of-scope programs (Lens Creator Rewards, Creator Subscriptions) come back only with `include_out_of_scope: true`.\n\nData minimization: we never accept or store a creator's age or birthdate. The age requirement is a yes/no/unknown input, `meets_age_requirement`.\n\nWe never return a made-up \"score\". We never look up a creator's metrics: every metric comes from the caller, because Snap has no public analytics for arbitrary usernames. Rules we could not verify from an official Snap source come back with `status: \"unverified\"`.\n\nAccess: The website calculators are free. The API and MCP server need an API key with a 14-day free trial or a paid plan. A free key that is not on a paid plan does not grant API or MCP access. The current list of tools is at /docs and /openapi.json. Send the key as `Authorization: Bearer` or `X-API-Key`. A missing key returns HTTP 401 `INVALID_API_KEY`. A free or lapsed key returns HTTP 402 `PAYMENT_REQUIRED`. Every response carries rate-limit headers (IETF RateLimit header fields). If you go over the limit you get HTTP 429 with `Retry-After`. Limits live in Worker vars, not in handler code.\n\nThe same tools, with the same input and output schemas, are also exposed as a remote MCP server over streamable HTTP at `https://howtomakemoneyonsnapchat.com/mcp`. The server is read-only. The website calculators are free. The API and MCP server need an API key with a 14-day free trial or a paid plan. Its instructions include: Independent; not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Snap Inc.\n\nUnknown tool names return 404 `NOT_FOUND`. `/v2` returns `UNSUPPORTED_API_VERSION`. Calculation tools accept POST only (`METHOD_NOT_ALLOWED` otherwise). FACT tools also have cacheable GET aliases. Unknown query parameters on those GET aliases are ignored. The HTTP status stays 200, and the JSON body includes `warnings` entries of the form `ignored query parameter: <name>`. JSON request bodies stay strict: an unknown field is HTTP 400 `UNKNOWN_FIELD`.\n\ncalculate_payout_timeline is a CALCULATION. It dates Snap's payout steps from a credited date, an optional USD amount, and an optional tax-verification flag. Every step cites a rule id and a Snap source URL. A source that says \"or longer\" or \"up to\" stays a range. It does not look up an account. The result is an estimate, not a promise.\n\nCalculation tools (`check_eligibility`, `calculate_gap`, `calculate_growth_pace`) apply the same plausibility checks on REST, MCP, and the calculator GET form. `spotlight_view_time_hours_28d` greater than `view_time_hours_28d` is HTTP 400 `VALUE_INCONSISTENT`, and `fields` names both metrics. View hours above 28 days × 24 hours × followers × 0.5 are a plain string in `warnings`, and the calculation still runs. The warning says the figure is unusually high for your follower count, please check for a typo, and that view time can come from non-followers. Followers of 0 with hours above 0 is the same kind of warning, including when that makes the 0.5 bound zero. Those strings are appended to the same `warnings` array as ignored query parameters.\n\nGET `/v1/rule-changes` with no parameters defaults `since` to 90 days before the request's UTC date and `until` to the UTC date of the request. The response keeps top-level `since` and `until`, and echoes the applied values in `query`. POST and MCP `get_rule_changes` use the same defaults.\n\nEvery error body uses the closed `error.code` enum, with `fix` and `docs_url`.\n\nWebsite calculator submissions, overridable by Worker vars and not hard-coded in handlers: 60 requests per 60 seconds and 5,000 requests per day, keyed by an HMAC of the IP prefix (IPv4 /32, IPv6 /64). The browser identifier is not part of that key. API and MCP calls use the key's plan limit. Request bodies over 16,384 bytes return `PAYLOAD_TOO_LARGE`. This document is served at `/openapi.json`. Canonical host is https://howtomakemoneyonsnapchat.com. www.howtomakemoneyonsnapchat.com redirects there with HTTP 301.\n\n\nThe website calculators are free. The API and MCP server need an API key with a 14-day free trial or a paid plan. Start a trial at /pricing. 14 days free, then $4.99/month for Personal or $19/month for Pro. Cancel anytime before the trial ends to avoid being charged. After the trial, the subscription renews monthly until you cancel.\n","contact":{"name":"HowToMakeMoneyOnSnapchat.com","url":"https://howtomakemoneyonsnapchat.com"},"license":{"name":"Proprietary","identifier":"LicenseRef-Proprietary"}},"jsonSchemaDialect":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","servers":[{"url":"https://howtomakemoneyonsnapchat.com","description":"Canonical production host. www.howtomakemoneyonsnapchat.com 301-redirects here with the same path and query."}],"security":[{"bearerAuth":[]},{"apiKeyHeader":[]}],"tags":[{"name":"facts","description":"FACT tools. Official Snap rules with sources."},{"name":"calculations","description":"CALCULATION tools. Deterministic math on caller-supplied metrics. High view hours for a follower count are plain strings in warnings. Spotlight hours above total view hours return VALUE_INCONSISTENT."},{"name":"meta","description":"Health, this OpenAPI document, and the remote MCP endpoint."}],"paths":{"/v1/tools/get_monetization_requirements":{"get":{"tags":["facts"],"operationId":"get_monetization_requirements_tool_get","summary":"Cacheable GET alias of get_monetization_requirements on the tool path.","parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/RequirementsProgram"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/RequirementsCountry"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/IncludeUnverified"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/IncludeHistorical"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/IncludeOutOfScope"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/RequirementPhase"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/AsOf"}],"responses":{"200":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/GetMonetizationRequirementsOK"},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error"},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Unauthorized"},"402":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/PaymentRequired"},"405":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error"},"429":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/RateLimited"},"503":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error"}}},"post":{"tags":["facts"],"operationId":"get_monetization_requirements","summary":"Current Snapchat monetization requirements per program, each with source and verification date.","description":"Use this to get the rules themselves. To compare a creator's numbers against them, use check_eligibility or calculate_gap.","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/get_monetization_requirements.input.schema"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/GetMonetizationRequirementsOK"},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error"},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Unauthorized"},"402":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/PaymentRequired"},"413":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error"},"429":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/RateLimited"},"500":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error"},"503":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error"}}}},"/v1/requirements":{"get":{"tags":["facts"],"operationId":"get_monetization_requirements_get","summary":"Cacheable GET alias of get_monetization_requirements.","parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/RequirementsProgram"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/RequirementsCountry"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/IncludeUnverified"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/IncludeHistorical"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/IncludeOutOfScope"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/RequirementPhase"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/AsOf"}],"responses":{"200":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/GetMonetizationRequirementsOK"},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error"},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Unauthorized"},"429":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/RateLimited"},"503":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error"}}}},"/v1/tools/get_rule_changes":{"get":{"tags":["facts"],"operationId":"get_rule_changes_tool_get","summary":"Cacheable GET alias of get_rule_changes on the tool path.","parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/Since"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/Until"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/ChangesProgram"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/Limit"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/Cursor"}],"responses":{"200":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/GetRuleChangesOK"},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error"},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Unauthorized"},"402":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/PaymentRequired"},"405":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error"},"422":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error"},"429":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/RateLimited"},"503":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error"}}},"post":{"tags":["facts"],"operationId":"get_rule_changes","summary":"Changes to Snap monetization rules since a date (previous value, new value, source, detected date).","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/get_rule_changes.input.schema"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/GetRuleChangesOK"},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error"},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Unauthorized"},"402":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/PaymentRequired"},"413":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error"},"422":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error"},"429":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/RateLimited"},"500":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error"},"503":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error"}}}},"/v1/rule-changes":{"get":{"tags":["facts"],"operationId":"get_rule_changes_get","summary":"Cacheable GET alias of get_rule_changes (also basis for the RSS/JSON feed).","parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/Since"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/Until"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/ChangesProgram"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/Limit"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/Cursor"}],"responses":{"200":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/GetRuleChangesOK"},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error"},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Unauthorized"},"422":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error"},"429":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/RateLimited"},"503":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error"}}}},"/v1/tools/check_eligibility":{"post":{"tags":["calculations"],"operationId":"check_eligibility","summary":"Creator metrics in; pass/fail for each published entry requirement, plus unknowns and requirements that need the creator's confirmation. The result is meets_published_criteria, does_not_meet_published_criteria or unknown, never \"eligible\".","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/check_eligibility.input.schema"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Eligibility evaluation (CALCULATION) with the FACTs it used.","headers":{"RateLimit-Limit":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/RateLimit-Limit"},"RateLimit-Remaining":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/RateLimit-Remaining"},"RateLimit-Reset":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/RateLimit-Reset"},"X-Request-Id":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-Request-Id"}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/check_eligibility.output.schema"},"example":{"tool":"check_eligibility","api_version":"v1","notice":"HowToMakeMoneyOnSnapchat.com is an independent third party and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Snap Inc. Snapchat is a trademark of Snap Inc.","generated_at":"2026-10-01T00:00:00Z","sources":[{"url":"https://www.snap.com/monetization-terms?lang=en-US","publisher":"Snap Inc. (snap.com legal terms)","title":"Snap Monetization Terms","verified_at":"2026-09-26","supports_rule_ids":["ump.invitation_only","ump.account_good_standing","ump.excluded_parties","ump.age_min_terms"]},{"url":"https://help.snapchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/14669003687444-About-Snapchat-s-Monetization-Program","publisher":"Snap Inc. (Snapchat Support)","title":"About Snapchat’s Monetization Program","verified_at":"2026-09-26","supports_rule_ids":["ump.followers_min","ump.age_min_help_page","ump.snap_star_required","ump.original_advertiser_friendly_content","ump.comply_terms_policy","ump.view_time_hours_28d_min","ump.spotlight_view_time_hours_28d_min","ump.spotlight_min_video_length_seconds"]},{"url":"https://help.snapchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/7012309512724-What-are-Creator-Rewards-and-how-can-I-earn-them","publisher":"Snap Inc. (Snapchat Support)","title":"What are Creator Rewards and how can I earn them?","verified_at":"2026-09-26","supports_rule_ids":["ump.country_eligible"]}],"data_freshness":{"rules_db_version":"2026-09-30.4","generated_at":"2026-10-01T00:00:00Z","oldest_verified_at":"2026-09-26","newest_verified_at":"2026-09-27","stale_rule_ids":[],"policy":"Sources are re-checked daily; a rule is listed as stale when the later of verified_at and last_checked_at is more than 7 days before the response date."},"program":"unified_monetization_program","already_enrolled":false,"summary":{"published_criteria_status":"does_not_meet_published_criteria","disclaimer":"Does not meet the published criteria based on the inputs provided; invitation to the Monetization Program is at Snap's discretion.","pass_count":2,"fail_count":4,"unknown_count":0,"requires_confirmation_count":5},"requirements":[{"label":"CALCULATION","rule_id":"ump.invitation_only","rule_version":1,"claim":"The Monetization Program is open by invitation only; meeting the criteria does not guarantee an invitation. Snap notifies invited creators by email.","rule_status":"current","metric":null,"operator":null,"threshold":{"value":true,"unit":"boolean"},"input_value":null,"outcome":"requires_user_confirmation","explanation":""},{"label":"CALCULATION","rule_id":"ump.followers_min","rule_version":1,"claim":"Creators may be eligible for invitation if they have at least 50,000 followers.","rule_status":"current","metric":"followers","operator":"gte","threshold":{"value":50000,"unit":"followers"},"input_value":32000,"outcome":"fail","explanation":"32,000 < 50,000"},{"label":"CALCULATION","rule_id":"ump.age_min_help_page","rule_version":1,"claim":"Be at least 18 years old or the local age of legal majority in your country (primary age requirement shown to users).","rule_status":"current","metric":"meets_age_requirement","operator":"is_true","threshold":{"value":"18 or the local age of majority","unit":"text"},"input_value":null,"outcome":"requires_user_confirmation","explanation":"meets_age_requirement is null; the creator must confirm (age is never collected)"},{"label":"CALCULATION","rule_id":"ump.country_eligible","rule_version":1,"claim":"Creator must reside in an eligible country. Countries listed for 'Snapchat Monetization Program Ads within Stories and Spotlights' payouts.","rule_status":"current","metric":"country","operator":"in","threshold":{"value":["Algeria","Argentina","Australia","Austria","Bahrain","Belgium","Brazil","Canada","Colombia","Denmark","Egypt","Finland","France","Germany","India","Indonesia","Ireland","Italy","Jordan","Korea (the Republic of)","Kuwait","Lebanon","Libya","Malaysia","Mexico","Morocco","Netherlands (the)","New Zealand","Nigeria","Norway","Oman","Pakistan","Palestine","Philippines (the)","Poland","Qatar","Saudi Arabia","Singapore","Spain","Sweden","United Arab Emirates","United Kingdom","United States"],"unit":"country_names"},"input_value":"US","outcome":"pass","explanation":"United States is listed"},{"label":"CALCULATION","rule_id":"ump.snap_star_required","rule_version":1,"claim":"Creator must be a Snap Star to be eligible for invitation.","rule_status":"current","metric":"is_snap_star","operator":"is_true","threshold":{"value":true,"unit":"boolean"},"input_value":false,"outcome":"user_denied","explanation":"Caller reported is_snap_star=false"},{"label":"CALCULATION","rule_id":"ump.original_advertiser_friendly_content","rule_version":1,"claim":"Publish original, advertiser-friendly content compliant with Community Guidelines and Content Guidelines for Recommendation Eligibility.","rule_status":"current","metric":null,"operator":null,"threshold":{"value":true,"unit":"boolean"},"input_value":null,"outcome":"requires_user_confirmation","explanation":""},{"label":"CALCULATION","rule_id":"ump.comply_terms_policy","rule_version":1,"claim":"Comply with the Monetization Terms and the Creator Monetization Policy.","rule_status":"current","metric":null,"operator":null,"threshold":{"value":true,"unit":"boolean"},"input_value":null,"outcome":"requires_user_confirmation","explanation":""},{"label":"CALCULATION","rule_id":"ump.account_good_standing","rule_version":1,"claim":"Snapchat account and Payment Account must be active, in good standing (as determined by Snap), and compliant with the Monetization Terms at all times; creator must pass Snap's and the Payment Provider's compliance review.","rule_status":"current","metric":null,"operator":null,"threshold":{"value":true,"unit":"boolean"},"input_value":null,"outcome":"user_confirmed","explanation":"Caller confirmed; not verified by us"},{"label":"CALCULATION","rule_id":"ump.excluded_parties","rule_version":1,"claim":"Snap employees/officers/directors (and of its affiliates), government entities and their affiliates, and members of a royal family are not eligible.","rule_status":"current","metric":null,"operator":null,"threshold":{"value":true,"unit":"boolean"},"input_value":null,"outcome":"requires_user_confirmation","explanation":""},{"label":"CALCULATION","rule_id":"ump.view_time_hours_28d_min","rule_version":2,"claim":"Achieve 15,000 hours of view time over the last 28 days.","rule_status":"current","metric":"view_time_hours_28d","operator":"gte","threshold":{"value":15000,"unit":"hours"},"input_value":9500,"outcome":"fail","explanation":"9,500 < 15,000"},{"label":"CALCULATION","rule_id":"ump.spotlight_view_time_hours_28d_min","rule_version":2,"claim":"At least 3,000 of the 15,000 hours of view time over the last 28 days must come from Spotlight.","rule_status":"current","metric":"spotlight_view_time_hours_28d","operator":"gte","threshold":{"value":3000,"unit":"hours"},"input_value":1200,"outcome":"fail","explanation":"1,200 < 3,000"}],"ongoing_requirements":null,"unknowns":[{"rule_id":"ump.invitation_only","reason":"requires_user_confirmation","missing_metric":null,"how_to_resolve":"Creator confirms: The Monetization Program is open by invitation only; meeting the criteria does not guarantee an invitation. Snap notifies invited creators by email."},{"rule_id":"ump.age_min_help_page","reason":"requires_user_confirmation","missing_metric":"meets_age_requirement","how_to_resolve":"Set metrics.meets_age_requirement to true or false (18 or the local age of majority; where applicable see ump.age_min_terms)."},{"rule_id":"ump.original_advertiser_friendly_content","reason":"requires_user_confirmation","missing_metric":null,"how_to_resolve":"Creator confirms: Publish original, advertiser-friendly content compliant with Community Guidelines and Content Guidelines for Recommendation Eligibility."},{"rule_id":"ump.comply_terms_policy","reason":"requires_user_confirmation","missing_metric":null,"how_to_resolve":"Creator confirms: Comply with the Monetization Terms and the Creator Monetization Policy."},{"rule_id":"ump.excluded_parties","reason":"requires_user_confirmation","missing_metric":null,"how_to_resolve":"Creator confirms: Snap employees/officers/directors (and of its affiliates), government entities and their affiliates, and members of a royal family are not eligible."}],"facts":[{"label":"FACT","rule_id":"ump.invitation_only","version":1,"program":"unified_monetization_program","claim":"The Monetization Program is open by invitation only; meeting the criteria does not guarantee an invitation. Snap notifies invited creators by email.","value":true,"unit":"boolean","metric":null,"operator":null,"window_days":null,"rule_type":"program_fact","status":"current","source_url":"https://www.snap.com/monetization-terms?lang=en-US","publisher":"Snap Inc. (snap.com legal terms)","verified_at":"2026-09-26","effective_date":"2025-02-01","changed_after":null,"changed_before":null,"date_note":null,"requires_user_confirmation":true,"supersedes":null,"applies_to":"entry","requirement_phase":"entry","mvp_scope":"in_scope","related_rule_ids":[],"notes":"Effective date is the Monetization Terms effective date (February 1, 2025). Invitation cannot be computed from metrics; engine must report it as requires_user_confirmation. Help page also states Snap does not charge fees for invitation and no third party controls eligibility."},{"label":"FACT","rule_id":"ump.followers_min","version":1,"program":"unified_monetization_program","claim":"Creators may be eligible for invitation if they have at least 50,000 followers.","value":50000,"unit":"followers","metric":"followers","operator":"gte","window_days":null,"rule_type":"eligibility_threshold","status":"current","source_url":"https://help.snapchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/14669003687444-About-Snapchat-s-Monetization-Program","publisher":"Snap Inc. (Snapchat Support)","verified_at":"2026-09-26","effective_date":null,"effective_date_note":"not published by Snap","changed_after":null,"changed_before":null,"date_note":null,"requires_user_confirmation":false,"supersedes":null,"applies_to":"entry","requirement_phase":"entry","mvp_scope":"in_scope","related_rule_ids":[],"notes":"Effective date not stated on the source page. Same 50,000 figure also appeared in the Dec 16, 2024 newsroom announcement."},{"label":"FACT","rule_id":"ump.age_min_help_page","version":1,"program":"unified_monetization_program","claim":"Be at least 18 years old or the local age of legal majority in your country (primary age requirement shown to users).","value":"18 or the local age of majority","unit":"text","metric":"meets_age_requirement","operator":"is_true","window_days":null,"rule_type":"eligibility_threshold","status":"current","source_url":"https://help.snapchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/14669003687444-About-Snapchat-s-Monetization-Program","publisher":"Snap Inc. (Snapchat Support)","verified_at":"2026-09-26","effective_date":null,"effective_date_note":"not published by Snap","changed_after":null,"changed_before":null,"date_note":null,"requires_user_confirmation":true,"supersedes":null,"applies_to":"entry","requirement_phase":"entry","mvp_scope":"in_scope","related_rule_ids":["ump.age_min_terms"],"notes":"Primary age requirement (help page). Supplementary, where applicable: the Monetization Terms' Minimum Eligibility mentions participation from age 16 with parental consent (see ump.age_min_terms); this is a note, not an equal alternative. Tools accept only meets_age_requirement: true/false/null (null returns requires_user_confirmation). Creator age is never collected or stored."},{"label":"FACT","rule_id":"ump.country_eligible","version":1,"program":"unified_monetization_program","claim":"Creator must reside in an eligible country. Countries listed for 'Snapchat Monetization Program Ads within Stories and Spotlights' payouts.","value":["Algeria","Argentina","Australia","Austria","Bahrain","Belgium","Brazil","Canada","Colombia","Denmark","Egypt","Finland","France","Germany","India","Indonesia","Ireland","Italy","Jordan","Korea (the Republic of)","Kuwait","Lebanon","Libya","Malaysia","Mexico","Morocco","Netherlands (the)","New Zealand","Nigeria","Norway","Oman","Pakistan","Palestine","Philippines (the)","Poland","Qatar","Saudi Arabia","Singapore","Spain","Sweden","United Arab Emirates","United Kingdom","United States"],"unit":"country_names","metric":"country","operator":"in","window_days":null,"rule_type":"eligibility_threshold","status":"current","source_url":"https://help.snapchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/7012309512724-What-are-Creator-Rewards-and-how-can-I-earn-them","publisher":"Snap Inc. (Snapchat Support)","verified_at":"2026-09-26","effective_date":null,"effective_date_note":"not published by Snap","changed_after":null,"changed_before":null,"date_note":null,"iso_countries":[{"snap_name":"Algeria","alpha2":"DZ","alpha3":"DZA","numeric":"012"},{"snap_name":"Argentina","alpha2":"AR","alpha3":"ARG","numeric":"032"},{"snap_name":"Australia","alpha2":"AU","alpha3":"AUS","numeric":"036"},{"snap_name":"Austria","alpha2":"AT","alpha3":"AUT","numeric":"040"},{"snap_name":"Bahrain","alpha2":"BH","alpha3":"BHR","numeric":"048"},{"snap_name":"Belgium","alpha2":"BE","alpha3":"BEL","numeric":"056"},{"snap_name":"Brazil","alpha2":"BR","alpha3":"BRA","numeric":"076"},{"snap_name":"Canada","alpha2":"CA","alpha3":"CAN","numeric":"124"},{"snap_name":"Colombia","alpha2":"CO","alpha3":"COL","numeric":"170"},{"snap_name":"Denmark","alpha2":"DK","alpha3":"DNK","numeric":"208"},{"snap_name":"Egypt","alpha2":"EG","alpha3":"EGY","numeric":"818"},{"snap_name":"Finland","alpha2":"FI","alpha3":"FIN","numeric":"246"},{"snap_name":"France","alpha2":"FR","alpha3":"FRA","numeric":"250"},{"snap_name":"Germany","alpha2":"DE","alpha3":"DEU","numeric":"276"},{"snap_name":"India","alpha2":"IN","alpha3":"IND","numeric":"356"},{"snap_name":"Indonesia","alpha2":"ID","alpha3":"IDN","numeric":"360"},{"snap_name":"Ireland","alpha2":"IE","alpha3":"IRL","numeric":"372"},{"snap_name":"Italy","alpha2":"IT","alpha3":"ITA","numeric":"380"},{"snap_name":"Jordan","alpha2":"JO","alpha3":"JOR","numeric":"400"},{"snap_name":"Korea (the Republic of)","alpha2":"KR","alpha3":"KOR","numeric":"410"},{"snap_name":"Kuwait","alpha2":"KW","alpha3":"KWT","numeric":"414"},{"snap_name":"Lebanon","alpha2":"LB","alpha3":"LBN","numeric":"422"},{"snap_name":"Libya","alpha2":"LY","alpha3":"LBY","numeric":"434"},{"snap_name":"Malaysia","alpha2":"MY","alpha3":"MYS","numeric":"458"},{"snap_name":"Mexico","alpha2":"MX","alpha3":"MEX","numeric":"484"},{"snap_name":"Morocco","alpha2":"MA","alpha3":"MAR","numeric":"504"},{"snap_name":"Netherlands (the)","alpha2":"NL","alpha3":"NLD","numeric":"528"},{"snap_name":"New Zealand","alpha2":"NZ","alpha3":"NZL","numeric":"554"},{"snap_name":"Nigeria","alpha2":"NG","alpha3":"NGA","numeric":"566"},{"snap_name":"Norway","alpha2":"NO","alpha3":"NOR","numeric":"578"},{"snap_name":"Oman","alpha2":"OM","alpha3":"OMN","numeric":"512"},{"snap_name":"Pakistan","alpha2":"PK","alpha3":"PAK","numeric":"586"},{"snap_name":"Palestine","alpha2":"PS","alpha3":"PSE","numeric":"275"},{"snap_name":"Philippines (the)","alpha2":"PH","alpha3":"PHL","numeric":"608"},{"snap_name":"Poland","alpha2":"PL","alpha3":"POL","numeric":"616"},{"snap_name":"Qatar","alpha2":"QA","alpha3":"QAT","numeric":"634"},{"snap_name":"Saudi Arabia","alpha2":"SA","alpha3":"SAU","numeric":"682"},{"snap_name":"Singapore","alpha2":"SG","alpha3":"SGP","numeric":"702"},{"snap_name":"Spain","alpha2":"ES","alpha3":"ESP","numeric":"724"},{"snap_name":"Sweden","alpha2":"SE","alpha3":"SWE","numeric":"752"},{"snap_name":"United Arab Emirates","alpha2":"AE","alpha3":"ARE","numeric":"784"},{"snap_name":"United Kingdom","alpha2":"GB","alpha3":"GBR","numeric":"826"},{"snap_name":"United States","alpha2":"US","alpha3":"USA","numeric":"840"}],"requires_user_confirmation":false,"supersedes":null,"applies_to":"entry","requirement_phase":"entry","mvp_scope":"in_scope","related_rule_ids":[],"notes":"43 countries. Identical list appears on the payout-countries help article under the older label 'Creator Midroll Ads within Stories'. The Creator Rewards FAQ (5909152630420) shows a shorter, older-looking generic list (37 countries; missing Colombia, Lebanon, Malaysia, Pakistan, Poland, Spain) — treated as stale; flagged for operator review. Monetization Terms say the Eligible Regions list is in the 'Creator Rewards Guidelines', which we could not locate as a standalone page. Engine must map ISO codes to these names in a reviewed lookup table."},{"label":"FACT","rule_id":"ump.snap_star_required","version":1,"program":"unified_monetization_program","claim":"Creator must be a Snap Star to be eligible for invitation.","value":true,"unit":"boolean","metric":"is_snap_star","operator":"is_true","window_days":null,"rule_type":"eligibility_condition","status":"current","source_url":"https://help.snapchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/14669003687444-About-Snapchat-s-Monetization-Program","publisher":"Snap Inc. (Snapchat Support)","verified_at":"2026-09-26","effective_date":null,"effective_date_note":"not published by Snap","changed_after":null,"changed_before":null,"date_note":null,"requires_user_confirmation":true,"supersedes":null,"applies_to":"entry","requirement_phase":"entry","mvp_scope":"in_scope","related_rule_ids":[],"notes":"Snap Star status is granted by Snap after application; a user may self-report it, but we cannot verify it. Treated as requires_user_confirmation."},{"label":"FACT","rule_id":"ump.original_advertiser_friendly_content","version":1,"program":"unified_monetization_program","claim":"Publish original, advertiser-friendly content compliant with Community Guidelines and Content Guidelines for Recommendation Eligibility.","value":true,"unit":"boolean","metric":null,"operator":null,"window_days":null,"rule_type":"eligibility_condition","status":"current","source_url":"https://help.snapchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/14669003687444-About-Snapchat-s-Monetization-Program","publisher":"Snap Inc. (Snapchat Support)","verified_at":"2026-09-26","effective_date":null,"effective_date_note":"not published by Snap","changed_after":null,"changed_before":null,"date_note":null,"requires_user_confirmation":true,"supersedes":null,"applies_to":"entry","requirement_phase":"entry","mvp_scope":"in_scope","related_rule_ids":[],"notes":"Qualitative; cannot be checked from metrics."},{"label":"FACT","rule_id":"ump.comply_terms_policy","version":1,"program":"unified_monetization_program","claim":"Comply with the Monetization Terms and the Creator Monetization Policy.","value":true,"unit":"boolean","metric":null,"operator":null,"window_days":null,"rule_type":"eligibility_condition","status":"current","source_url":"https://help.snapchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/14669003687444-About-Snapchat-s-Monetization-Program","publisher":"Snap Inc. (Snapchat Support)","verified_at":"2026-09-26","effective_date":null,"effective_date_note":"not published by Snap","changed_after":null,"changed_before":null,"date_note":null,"requires_user_confirmation":true,"supersedes":null,"applies_to":"all","requirement_phase":"entry_and_ongoing","mvp_scope":"in_scope","related_rule_ids":[],"notes":"Qualitative; cannot be checked from metrics."},{"label":"FACT","rule_id":"ump.account_good_standing","version":1,"program":"unified_monetization_program","claim":"Snapchat account and Payment Account must be active, in good standing (as determined by Snap), and compliant with the Monetization Terms at all times; creator must pass Snap's and the Payment Provider's compliance review.","value":true,"unit":"boolean","metric":null,"operator":null,"window_days":null,"rule_type":"eligibility_condition","status":"current","source_url":"https://www.snap.com/monetization-terms?lang=en-US","publisher":"Snap Inc. (snap.com legal terms)","verified_at":"2026-09-26","effective_date":"2025-02-01","changed_after":null,"changed_before":null,"date_note":null,"requires_user_confirmation":true,"supersedes":null,"applies_to":"all","requirement_phase":"entry_and_ongoing","mvp_scope":"in_scope","related_rule_ids":[],"notes":"Determined by Snap; cannot be checked by us."},{"label":"FACT","rule_id":"ump.excluded_parties","version":1,"program":"unified_monetization_program","claim":"Snap employees/officers/directors (and of its affiliates), government entities and their affiliates, and members of a royal family are not eligible.","value":true,"unit":"boolean","metric":null,"operator":null,"window_days":null,"rule_type":"eligibility_condition","status":"current","source_url":"https://www.snap.com/monetization-terms?lang=en-US","publisher":"Snap Inc. (snap.com legal terms)","verified_at":"2026-09-26","effective_date":"2025-02-01","changed_after":null,"changed_before":null,"date_note":null,"requires_user_confirmation":true,"supersedes":null,"applies_to":"entry","requirement_phase":"entry","mvp_scope":"in_scope","related_rule_ids":[],"notes":"Self-attested condition."},{"label":"FACT","rule_id":"ump.view_time_hours_28d_min","version":2,"program":"unified_monetization_program","claim":"Achieve 15,000 hours of view time over the last 28 days.","value":15000,"unit":"hours","metric":"view_time_hours_28d","operator":"gte","window_days":28,"rule_type":"eligibility_threshold","status":"current","source_url":"https://help.snapchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/14669003687444-About-Snapchat-s-Monetization-Program","publisher":"Snap Inc. (Snapchat Support)","verified_at":"2026-09-27","effective_date":null,"effective_date_note":"not published by Snap","changed_after":"2026-02-16","changed_before":"2026-02-17","date_note":"per archived Snap help page (Wayback Machine snapshots of support article 14669003687444 on 2026-02-16 and 2026-02-17); not announced by Snap.","requires_user_confirmation":false,"supersedes":"ump.view_time_hours_28d_min@1","applies_to":"entry","requirement_phase":"entry","mvp_scope":"in_scope","related_rule_ids":["ump.view_metric_any_of_2024"],"notes":"Changed between Feb 16 and Feb 17, 2026 (archived captures of Snap's help page; not announced by Snap). Prior rule ump.view_metric_any_of_2024: one of 10 million Snap views, 1 million Spotlight views, or 12,000 hours of view time in the last 28 days. Source: Snap Newsroom, \"Snapchat Introduces New, Unified Monetization Program for Creators\", Dec 16, 2024, https://newsroom.snap.com/snapchat-new-creator-monetization, verified 2026-09-27. Whether the 15,000 hours count Stories and Spotlight combined is implied ('of those hours coming from Spotlight') but not defined on the page."},{"label":"FACT","rule_id":"ump.spotlight_view_time_hours_28d_min","version":2,"program":"unified_monetization_program","claim":"At least 3,000 of the 15,000 hours of view time over the last 28 days must come from Spotlight.","value":3000,"unit":"hours","metric":"spotlight_view_time_hours_28d","operator":"gte","window_days":28,"rule_type":"eligibility_threshold","status":"current","source_url":"https://help.snapchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/14669003687444-About-Snapchat-s-Monetization-Program","publisher":"Snap Inc. (Snapchat Support)","verified_at":"2026-09-27","effective_date":null,"effective_date_note":"not published by Snap","changed_after":"2026-02-16","changed_before":"2026-02-17","date_note":"per archived Snap help page (Wayback Machine snapshots of support article 14669003687444 on 2026-02-16 and 2026-02-17); not announced by Snap.","requires_user_confirmation":false,"supersedes":"ump.spotlight_view_time_hours_28d_min@1","applies_to":"entry","requirement_phase":"entry","mvp_scope":"in_scope","related_rule_ids":["ump.view_time_hours_28d_min"],"notes":"Entry (invitation) criterion from the same help-page edit as the 15,000-hour view-time rule. Changed between Feb 16 and Feb 17, 2026 (archived captures of Snap's help page; not announced by Snap). Distinct from the 100-hour ongoing threshold for already-enrolled creators (ump.ongoing_spotlight_view_time_hours_28d_max_rewards)."},{"label":"FACT","rule_id":"ump.age_min_terms","version":1,"program":"unified_monetization_program","claim":"Monetization Terms Minimum Eligibility: individuals must be at least the age of legal majority in their jurisdiction (or, if applicable, at least 16 years old with parental consent); entities' representatives must be at least 18 (or legal age of majority).","value":"age of legal majority in jurisdiction; or at least 16 with parental/guardian consent where applicable","unit":"text","metric":null,"operator":null,"window_days":null,"rule_type":"supplementary_note","status":"current","source_url":"https://www.snap.com/monetization-terms?lang=en-US","publisher":"Snap Inc. (snap.com legal terms)","verified_at":"2026-09-26","effective_date":"2025-02-01","changed_after":null,"changed_before":null,"date_note":null,"requires_user_confirmation":true,"supersedes":null,"applies_to":"not_applicable","requirement_phase":"not_applicable","mvp_scope":"in_scope","related_rule_ids":["ump.age_min_help_page"],"notes":"Supplementary note referenced from ump.age_min_help_page ('where applicable'). Not an equal alternative to the primary requirement of 18 or the local age of majority. Requires user confirmation because majority age and parental-consent rules depend on jurisdiction."},{"label":"FACT","rule_id":"ump.spotlight_min_video_length_seconds","version":2,"program":"unified_monetization_program","claim":"For Spotlight videos to be eligible to earn revenue, they must be at least 30 seconds long.","value":30,"unit":"seconds","metric":"spotlight_video_length_seconds","operator":"gte","window_days":null,"rule_type":"eligibility_threshold","status":"current","source_url":"https://help.snapchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/14669003687444-About-Snapchat-s-Monetization-Program","publisher":"Snap Inc. (Snapchat Support)","verified_at":"2026-09-26","effective_date":null,"effective_date_note":"not published by Snap","changed_after":"2026-07-23","changed_before":"2026-07-31","date_note":"per archived Snap help page (Wayback Machine snapshots of support article 14669003687444 on 2026-07-23 and 2026-07-31); not announced by Snap.","requires_user_confirmation":false,"supersedes":"ump.spotlight_min_video_length_seconds@1","applies_to":"entry","requirement_phase":"entry","mvp_scope":"in_scope","related_rule_ids":[],"notes":"Per-video condition, not an account eligibility criterion. Effective date not stated. Supersedes the Dec 2024 announcement that Spotlight videos 'longer than 1 minute' could be monetized (ump.spotlight_min_video_length_2024). Classified as an entry-type rule per the operator's 2026-09-26 fix; it is a per-video condition, so v1 calculators list it as a FACT and do not evaluate it. Changed between July 23 and July 31, 2026 (archived captures of Snap's help page; not announced by Snap). The 2026-07-23 capture still says Spotlight videos must be at least 1 minute long. The 2026-07-31 capture says they must be at least 30 seconds long."}]}}}},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error"},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Unauthorized"},"402":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/PaymentRequired"},"405":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error"},"413":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error"},"422":{"$ref":"#/components/responses