y-Creator-Rewards-on-Snapchat","publisher":"Snap Inc. (Snapchat Support)","verified_at":"2026-09-26","effective_date":null,"effective_date_note":"not published by Snap","changed_after":null,"changed_before":null,"date_note":null,"requires_user_confirmation":false,"supersedes":null,"applies_to":"enrolled_creators","requirement_phase":"not_applicable","mvp_scope":"in_scope","related_rule_ids":[],"notes":"'Typically ... or longer' — a typical minimum, not a guarantee."},{"label":"FACT","rule_id":"payouts.provider_hyperwallet","version":1,"program":"payouts","claim":"Payouts are made via the Snapchat Payout Portal operated by Hyperwallet; onboarding requires legal name, email, state/country, phone and birthdate matching tax documents/ID, then Hyperwallet activation.","value":"Hyperwallet (Snapchat Payout Portal)","unit":"text","metric":null,"operator":null,"window_days":null,"rule_type":"payout_term","status":"current","source_url":"https://help.snapchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/7012324940948-How-do-I-set-up-my-Payout-Portal-and-cash-out-my-Creator-Rewards-on-Snapchat","publisher":"Snap Inc. (Snapchat Support)","verified_at":"2026-09-26","effective_date":null,"effective_date_note":"not published by Snap","changed_after":null,"changed_before":null,"date_note":null,"requires_user_confirmation":true,"supersedes":null,"applies_to":"enrolled_creators","requirement_phase":"not_applicable","mvp_scope":"in_scope","related_rule_ids":[],"notes":"Being fully onboarded for payouts is a prerequisite to cash out (help page 14669003687444)."},{"label":"FACT","rule_id":"tax.taxpayer_verification_days_max","version":1,"program":"tax","claim":"Taxpayer verification in the Payout Portal can take up to 2 weeks.","value":14,"unit":"days","metric":null,"operator":null,"window_days":null,"rule_type":"tax_term","status":"current","source_url":"https://help.snapchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/7012324940948-How-do-I-set-up-my-Payout-Portal-and-cash-out-my-Creator-Rewards-on-Snapchat","publisher":"Snap Inc. (Snapchat Support)","verified_at":"2026-09-26","effective_date":null,"effective_date_note":"not published by Snap","changed_after":null,"changed_before":null,"date_note":null,"requires_user_confirmation":false,"supersedes":null,"applies_to":"enrolled_creators","requirement_phase":"not_applicable","mvp_scope":"in_scope","related_rule_ids":[],"notes":"Stated as 'up to 2 weeks'; stored as 14 days."},{"label":"FACT","rule_id":"tax.forms_w9_w8","version":1,"program":"tax","claim":"Onboarding to the Snapchat Payout Portal requires a valid W-9 (US) or W-8 (international) form; year-end tax forms are available under Resources > Tax Documents, issued per IRS deadlines (usually January/February).","value":"W-9 (US) / W-8 (international)","unit":"text","metric":null,"operator":null,"window_days":null,"rule_type":"tax_term","status":"current","source_url":"https://help.snapchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/5909152630420-Creator-Rewards-FAQ","publisher":"Snap Inc. (Snapchat Support)","verified_at":"2026-09-26","effective_date":null,"effective_date_note":"not published by Snap","changed_after":null,"changed_before":null,"date_note":null,"requires_user_confirmation":true,"supersedes":null,"applies_to":"enrolled_creators","requirement_phase":"not_applicable","mvp_scope":"in_scope","related_rule_ids":[],"notes":"Payout Portal article adds taxpayer verification can take up to 2 weeks."},{"label":"FACT","rule_id":"payouts.currency_usd_fees","version":1,"program":"payouts","claim":"Payments are made in USD; withdrawing in local currency or via a given method (e.g., bank account, PayPal) is subject to the payment provider's transaction/exchange fees.","value":"USD; provider withdrawal fees apply","unit":"text","metric":null,"operator":null,"window_days":null,"rule_type":"payout_term","status":"current","source_url":"https://www.snap.com/monetization-terms?lang=en-US","publisher":"Snap Inc. (snap.com legal terms)","verified_at":"2026-09-26","effective_date":"2025-02-01","changed_after":null,"changed_before":null,"date_note":null,"requires_user_confirmation":false,"supersedes":null,"applies_to":"enrolled_creators","requirement_phase":"not_applicable","mvp_scope":"in_scope","related_rule_ids":[],"notes":"Fee amounts are set by the payment provider and were not verified (provider fee page not fetched)."},{"label":"FACT","rule_id":"payouts.auto_disbursement","version":1,"program":"payouts","claim":"If there is no Qualifying Activity for one year, or no valid payment request for two years, Snap will disburse attributed payments at the end of that period, subject to compliance; otherwise the creator loses eligibility for that payment.","value":"1 year inactivity or 2 years without request","unit":"text","metric":null,"operator":null,"window_days":null,"rule_type":"payout_term","status":"current","source_url":"https://www.snap.com/monetization-terms?lang=en-US","publisher":"Snap Inc. (snap.com legal terms)","verified_at":"2026-09-26","effective_date":"2025-02-01","changed_after":null,"changed_before":null,"date_note":null,"requires_user_confirmation":false,"supersedes":null,"applies_to":"enrolled_creators","requirement_phase":"not_applicable","mvp_scope":"in_scope","related_rule_ids":[],"notes":"Payout Portal article phrases it as available balance unchanged for one year OR not cashed out in two years, and requires at least $100 available."},{"label":"FACT","rule_id":"tax.creator_responsible","version":1,"program":"tax","claim":"Creators are solely responsible for taxes, duties, or fees on payments; Snap or its Payment Provider may withhold taxes where required by law.","value":true,"unit":"boolean","metric":null,"operator":null,"window_days":null,"rule_type":"tax_term","status":"current","source_url":"https://www.snap.com/monetization-terms?lang=en-US","publisher":"Snap Inc. (snap.com legal terms)","verified_at":"2026-09-26","effective_date":"2025-02-01","changed_after":null,"changed_before":null,"date_note":null,"requires_user_confirmation":false,"supersedes":null,"applies_to":"enrolled_creators","requirement_phase":"not_applicable","mvp_scope":"in_scope","related_rule_ids":[],"notes":"Not tax advice; engine must not compute tax."}],"recommendations":[{"label":"RECOMMENDATION","text":"Plan from the earliest Payout Portal date, and leave room for a later day. Snap may change the timing.","linked_rule_ids":["payouts.cash_out_to_portal_days"],"assumptions":["The credited date is the day the reward appeared in All Activity.","The amount is the available balance in USD.","Cash-out happens on the first day the balance is available.","Taxpayer verification is already finished."]}],"caveats":["Snap says the time from cash-out to the Payout Portal can take longer than the earliest date. This timeline has no latest date for that step.","This timeline ends when the cash reaches the Snapchat Payout Portal. The rules database has no number of days for a later withdrawal to a bank or another method.","Tax status was not supplied. Dates after Available assume taxpayer verification is already finished. If it is not, Snap says verification can take up to 14 days, and Snap does not say when that clock starts.","Payments are in USD. Withdrawing in another currency or by another method can include fees from the payment provider. Fee amounts are not in this timeline.","Creators are responsible for taxes on payments. This is not tax advice.","Snap's terms describe a disbursement after one year without qualifying activity, or two years without a valid payment request. Those periods are not cash-out dates on this timeline."],"estimate_disclaimer":"Snap may change this timing. This timeline is an estimate, not a promise."}}}},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error"},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Unauthorized"},"402":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/PaymentRequired"},"405":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error"},"413":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error"},"422":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error"},"429":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/RateLimited"},"500":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error"},"503":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error"}}}},"/v1/health":{"get":{"tags":["meta"],"operationId":"health","summary":"Liveness plus the published rules_db_version.","responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","headers":{"RateLimit-Limit":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/RateLimit-Limit"},"RateLimit-Remaining":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/RateLimit-Remaining"},"RateLimit-Reset":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/RateLimit-Reset"},"X-Request-Id":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-Request-Id"}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["status","rules_db_version","notice"],"properties":{"status":{"type":"string","enum":["ok","degraded"]},"rules_db_version":{"type":"string"},"notice":{"type":"string"}}}}}},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Unauthorized"},"405":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error"},"429":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/RateLimited"},"503":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error"}}}},"/openapi.json":{"get":{"tags":["meta"],"operationId":"openapi_document","summary":"This OpenAPI 3.1 document.","responses":{"200":{"description":"OpenAPI document bundled from the schemas in this repository.","headers":{"RateLimit-Limit":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/RateLimit-Limit"},"RateLimit-Remaining":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/RateLimit-Remaining"},"RateLimit-Reset":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/RateLimit-Reset"},"X-Request-Id":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-Request-Id"}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","description":"OpenAPI 3.1 document."}}}},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Unauthorized"},"429":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/RateLimited"}}}},"/v1/keys":{"post":{"tags":["meta"],"operationId":"issue_free_api_key","summary":"Issue a free API key. The secret is shown once.","description":"No email and no other personal data. The response contains the secret once. Only a SHA-256 hash with a server-side pepper is stored. The website calculators are free. The API and MCP server need an API key with a 14-day free trial or a paid plan. A free key that is not on a paid plan does not grant API or MCP access. Issuance is limited to 5 per network: IPv4 address or IPv6 /56 and to a global daily cap (Worker var KEY_ISSUE_GLOBAL_PER_DAY, default 500). When Turnstile is required, send turnstile_token. Turnstile is required only when both the site key and the secret are configured. Other body fields are ignored. A missing or invalid token returns 403 TURNSTILE_FAILED.\n","security":[],"responses":{"201":{"description":"Key issued. The secret will not be shown again.","headers":{"RateLimit-Limit":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/RateLimit-Limit"},"RateLimit-Remaining":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/RateLimit-Remaining"},"RateLimit-Reset":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/RateLimit-Reset"},"X-Request-Id":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-Request-Id"}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["notice","shown_once","key"],"properties":{"notice":{"type":"string"},"shown_once":{"const":true},"key":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["id","secret","created_at"],"properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"secret":{"type":"string"},"created_at":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"}}}}}}}},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Unauthorized"},"403":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/TurnstileFailed"},"413":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error"},"429":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/RateLimited"},"503":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error"}}}},"/mcp":{"get":{"tags":["meta"],"operationId":"mcp_get","summary":"Description of the remote MCP endpoint for browsers and JSON clients.","description":"A GET whose Accept header includes text/event-stream is the streamable HTTP transport. Any other GET returns a short HTML page, or JSON when Accept includes application/json and does not include text/html. POST behavior is unchanged.\n","responses":{"200":{"description":"HTML guide, JSON guide, or the streamable HTTP response.","headers":{"RateLimit-Limit":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/RateLimit-Limit"},"RateLimit-Remaining":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/RateLimit-Remaining"},"RateLimit-Reset":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/RateLimit-Reset"},"X-Request-Id":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-Request-Id"}},"content":{"text/html":{"schema":{"type":"string"}},"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":true,"required":["notice","kind","transport","url","tools","docs"],"properties":{"notice":{"type":"string"},"kind":{"const":"remote-mcp"},"transport":{"const":"streamable-http"},"url":{"type":"string"},"tools":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object"}},"docs":{"type":"string"}}}}}},"405":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error"}}},"post":{"tags":["meta"],"operationId":"mcp_post","summary":"Remote MCP streamable HTTP (stateless JSON responses).","description":"Read-only. The tools use the same handler functions as REST. The website calculators are free. The API and MCP server need an API key with a 14-day free trial or a paid plan. The canonical MCP URL is https://howtomakemoneyonsnapchat.com/mcp. The tool result text is the REST JSON body. Server instructions include \"Independent; not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Snap Inc.\"\n","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","description":"A JSON-RPC request (initialize, ping, tools/list, or tools/call)."}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"JSON-RPC result. Tool errors use the REST error schema inside the tool result text.","headers":{"RateLimit-Limit":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/RateLimit-Limit"},"RateLimit-Remaining":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/RateLimit-Remaining"},"RateLimit-Reset":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/RateLimit-Reset"},"X-Request-Id":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-Request-Id"}}},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error"},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Unauthorized"},"405":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error"},"413":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error"},"429":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/RateLimited"},"500":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error"}}}},"/v1/billing/checkout":{"post":{"tags":["meta"],"operationId":"start_trial","summary":"Start a trial","description":"Live mode. Creates a Stripe Checkout Session and returns the hosted URL. Personal and Pro are a 14-day trial with a card required, and a session can start without an API key. The webhook then issues the key. Tool calls require that key while it is trialing or active, or a complimentary key. A key that already has a subscription (active, trialing, past_due, unpaid, or paused, including one set to cancel at period end) is refused with 409. A used trial is also refused with 409. A complimentary key is refused with 409 and is never billed. Credits uses payment mode for a prepaid pack of 1,000 calls. Card data stays on Stripe. This path is omitted when STRIPE_SECRET_KEY is unset.","security":[{"bearerAuth":[]},{"apiKeyHeader":[]}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["plan"],"properties":{"plan":{"type":"string","enum":["personal","pro","credits"]},"email":{"type":"string"}}}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Hosted Checkout URL.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["notice","mode","plan","url"],"properties":{"notice":{"type":"string"},"mode":{"const":"live"},"plan":{"type":"string","enum":["personal","pro","credits"]},"url":{"type":"string"},"trial_days":{"type":"integer"}}}}}},"401":{"description":"The API key is missing or not valid."},"409":{"description":"This key already has a subscription. Use POST /v1/billing/portal to change or resume the plan."},"503":{"description":"Billing did not start."}}}},"/v1/billing/portal":{"post":{"tags":["meta"],"operationId":"manage_billing","summary":"Manage billing","description":"Creates a Stripe Billing Portal session for the API key's Stripe customer and returns the hosted URL. A key that has not completed checkout has no customer. A complimentary key is not billed and has no portal customer. Card data stays on Stripe. This path is omitted when STRIPE_SECRET_KEY is unset.","security":[{"bearerAuth":[]},{"apiKeyHeader":[]}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Hosted Billing Portal URL.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["url"],"properties":{"url":{"type":"string"}}}}}},"401":{"description":"The API key is missing or not valid."},"404":{"description":"There's no subscription for this key."},"503":{"description":"The billing portal did not start."}}}},"/v1/billing/webhook":{"post":{"tags":["meta"],"operationId":"stripe_webhook","summary":"Stripe webhook","description":"Verifies Stripe-Signature with STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET and updates the key's plan or credit balance. Handles checkout.session.completed, customer.subscription.updated, customer.subscription.deleted, invoice.paid, invoice.payment_succeeded, and invoice.payment_failed. A trial checkout stores status trialing and can issue a key. invoice.paid or invoice.payment_succeeded with amount_paid above zero stores active from trialing or past_due. A zero-amount invoice does not. customer.subscription.updated with status past_due, unpaid, or paused stores past_due without waiting for invoice.payment_failed. A trial key then returns 402 until a later paid invoice or an active subscription update. A subscription plan follows the subscription's current price: lookup key, then a configured price id. A later event, or a redelivery whose price or status disagrees with the stored row, corrects that row. An older event does not move a newer plan backward. A credit pack is applied once per event id. A subscription checkout for a different subscription is logged and does not replace the stored subscription. A second trial for the same email or customer is not given a key. An event for a complimentary key is ignored. Omitted when live billing is off.","security":[],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Event accepted, or already processed."},"400":{"description":"Signature missing, invalid, or outside the time window."}}}}},"components":{"securitySchemes":{"bearerAuth":{"type":"http","scheme":"bearer","description":"API key for a trial, an active plan, or a complimentary key. A missing or bad key returns 401. A free or lapsed key returns 402."},"apiKeyHeader":{"type":"apiKey","in":"header","name":"X-API-Key","description":"API key for a trial, an active plan, or a complimentary key."}},"headers":{"RateLimit-Limit":{"description":"Requests allowed in the current window. Website calculator submissions are keyed by an IP prefix (IPv4 /32 or IPv6 /64). API and MCP calls are keyed by the API key id.","schema":{"type":"integer"}},"RateLimit-Remaining":{"description":"Requests remaining in the current window.","schema":{"type":"integer"}},"RateLimit-Reset":{"description":"Seconds until the window resets.","schema":{"type":"integer"}},"Retry-After":{"description":"Seconds to wait before retrying (sent with 429).","schema":{"type":"integer"}},"X-Request-Id":{"description":"Correlation id, echoed in error bodies.","schema":{"type":"string"}}},"parameters":{"RequirementsProgram":{"name":"program","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[a-z0-9_]{2,64}$"}},"RequirementsCountry":{"name":"country","in":"query","required":false,"description":"ISO 3166-1 alpha-2, alpha-3, or an English country name. Adds country_eligibility. Does not remove facts. Reviewed aliases such as UK are accepted.","schema":{"type":"string","minLength":2,"maxLength":80}},"IncludeUnverified":{"name":"include_unverified","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"boolean","default":true}},"IncludeHistorical":{"name":"include_historical","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"boolean","default":false}},"IncludeOutOfScope":{"name":"include_out_of_scope","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"boolean","default":false}},"RequirementPhase":{"name":"requirement_phase","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","enum":["entry","ongoing","entry_and_ongoing","not_applicable"]}},"AsOf":{"name":"as_of","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"date"}},"Since":{"name":"since","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Inclusive lower bound on the change date. GET, POST, and MCP default this to 90 days before the request's UTC date. until defaults to the UTC date of the request. The response echoes the applied since and until at the top level and inside query. Unknown GET query parameters are ignored and listed in warnings.","schema":{"type":"string","format":"date"}},"Until":{"name":"until","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"date"}},"ChangesProgram":{"name":"program","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[a-z0-9_]{2,64}$"}},"Limit":{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":200,"default":50}},"Cursor":{"name":"cursor","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","maxLength":200}}},"responses":{"GetMonetizationRequirementsOK":{"description":"Sourced, dated requirement FACTs.","headers":{"RateLimit-Limit":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/RateLimit-Limit"},"RateLimit-Remaining":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/RateLimit-Remaining"},"RateLimit-Reset":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/RateLimit-Reset"},"X-Request-Id":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/X-Request-Id"}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/get_monetization_requirements.output.schema"},"example":{"tool":"get_monetization_requirements","api_version":"v1","notice":"HowToMakeMoneyOnSnapchat.com is an independent third party and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Snap Inc. Snapchat is a trademark of Snap Inc.","generated_at":"2026-10-01T00:00:00Z","sources":[{"url":"https://www.snap.com/monetization-terms?lang=en-US","publisher":"Snap Inc. (snap.com legal terms)","title":"Snap Monetization Terms","verified_at":"2026-09-26","supports_rule_ids":["ump.account_good_standing","ump.age_min_terms","ump.excluded_parties","ump.invalid_activity_excluded","ump.invitation_only","ump.non_us_physical_location","ump.payment_formula_proprietary"]},{"url":"https://help.snapchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/14669003687444-About-Snapchat-s-Monetization-Program","publisher":"Snap Inc. (Snapchat Support)","title":"About Snapchat’s Monetization Program","verified_at":"2026-09-26","supports_rule_ids":["ump.age_min_help_page","ump.comply_terms_policy","ump.followers_min","ump.no_invitation_fee","ump.no_third_party_controls_eligibility","ump.ongoing_spotlight_view_time_hours_28d_max_rewards","ump.original_advertiser_friendly_content","ump.revenue_source","ump.snap_star_required","ump.spotlight_min_video_length_seconds","ump.spotlight_view_time_hours_28d_min","ump.view_time_hours_28d_min"]},{"url":"https://help.snapchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/7012309512724-What-are-Creator-Rewards-and-how-can-I-earn-them","publisher":"Snap Inc. (Snapchat Support)","title":"What are Creator Rewards and how can I earn them?","verified_at":"2026-09-26","supports_rule_ids":["ump.country_eligible"]},{"url":"https://help.snapchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/47748552848660-How-do-I-track-my-100-Hours-of-Spotlight-View-Time-Last-28-days","publisher":"Snap Inc. (Snapchat Support)","title":"How do I track my 100 Hours of Spotlight View Time (Last 28 days)?","verified_at":"2026-09-28","supports_rule_ids":["ump.ongoing_spotlight_view_time_hours_28d_max_rewards"]}],"data_freshness":{"rules_db_version":"2026-09-30.4","generated_at":"2026-10-01T00:00:00Z","oldest_verified_at":"2026-09-26","newest_verified_at":"2026-09-28","stale_rule_ids":[],"policy":"Sources are re-checked daily; a rule is listed as stale when the later of verified_at and last_checked_at is more than 7 days before the response date."},"catalog_scope":{"mvp_in_force":51,"in_force_including_out_of_scope":63,"mvp_including_historical":66,"approved_total":79,"out_of_scope_programs":["creator_subscriptions","lens_creator_rewards"],"summary":"51 facts in MVP scope; 63 total including Creator Subscriptions, and Lens Creator Rewards; 66 in-scope records including historical"},"direct_answer":"To be considered for Snapchat's Monetization Program, Snap lists 50,000 followers, 15,000 hours of view time in the last 28 days (at least 3,000 hours from Spotlight), age 18 or the local age of majority, a country on the published list (43 countries), and Snap Star status. Accounts must also be in good standing, follow Snap's terms and content guidelines, and post original, advertiser-friendly content; Spotlight videos must be at least 30 seconds. Entry is by invitation from Snap, and when your numbers meet these, our tools say you 'meet the published criteria'; Snap decides who is invited.","query":{"program":"unified_monetization_program","country":"US","include_unverified":true,"include_historical":false,"include_out_of_scope":false,"requirement_phase":null,"as_of":"2026-10-01"},"programs":[{"program":"unified_monetization_program","program_status":"active","rule_ids":["ump.account_good_standing","ump.age_min_help_page","ump.age_min_terms","ump.comply_terms_policy","ump.country_eligible","ump.excluded_parties","ump.followers_min","ump.invalid_activity_excluded","ump.invitation_only","ump.no_invitation_fee","ump.no_third_party_controls_eligibility","ump.non_us_physical_location","ump.ongoing_spotlight_view_time_hours_28d_max_rewards","ump.original_advertiser_friendly_content","ump.payment_formula_proprietary","ump.revenue_source","ump.snap_star_required","ump.spotlight_min_video_length_seconds","ump.spotlight_view_time_hours_28d_min","ump.view_time_hours_28d_min"]}],"facts":[{"label":"FACT","rule_id":"ump.account_good_standing","version":1,"program":"unified_monetization_program","claim":"Snapchat account and Payment Account must be active, in good standing (as determined by Snap), and compliant with the Monetization Terms at all times; creator must pass Snap's and the Payment Provider's compliance review.","value":true,"unit":"boolean","metric":null,"operator":null,"window_days":null,"rule_type":"eligibility_condition","status":"current","source_url":"https://www.snap.com/monetization-terms?lang=en-US","publisher":"Snap Inc. (snap.com legal terms)","verified_at":"2026-09-26","effective_date":"2025-02-01","changed_after":null,"changed_before":null,"date_note":null,"requires_user_confirmation":true,"supersedes":null,"applies_to":"all","requirement_phase":"entry_and_ongoing","mvp_scope":"in_scope","related_rule_ids":[],"notes":"Determined by Snap; cannot be checked by us."},{"label":"FACT","rule_id":"ump.age_min_help_page","version":1,"program":"unified_monetization_program","claim":"Be at least 18 years old or the local age of legal majority in your country (primary age requirement shown to users).","value":"18 or the local age of majority","unit":"text","metric":"meets_age_requirement","operator":"is_true","window_days":null,"rule_type":"eligibility_threshold","status":"current","source_url":"https://help.snapchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/14669003687444-About-Snapchat-s-Monetization-Program","publisher":"Snap Inc. (Snapchat Support)","verified_at":"2026-09-26","effective_date":null,"effective_date_note":"not published by Snap","changed_after":null,"changed_before":null,"date_note":null,"requires_user_confirmation":true,"supersedes":null,"applies_to":"entry","requirement_phase":"entry","mvp_scope":"in_scope","related_rule_ids":["ump.age_min_terms"],"notes":"Primary age requirement (help page). Supplementary, where applicable: the Monetization Terms' Minimum Eligibility mentions participation from age 16 with parental consent (see ump.age_min_terms); this is a note, not an equal alternative. Tools accept only meets_age_requirement: true/false/null (null returns requires_user_confirmation). Creator age is never collected or stored."},{"label":"FACT","rule_id":"ump.age_min_terms","version":1,"program":"unified_monetization_program","claim":"Monetization Terms Minimum Eligibility: individuals must be at least the age of legal majority in their jurisdiction (or, if applicable, at least 16 years old with parental consent); entities' representatives must be at least 18 (or legal age of majority).","value":"age of legal majority in jurisdiction; or at least 16 with parental/guardian consent where applicable","unit":"text","metric":null,"operator":null,"window_days":null,"rule_type":"supplementary_note","status":"current","source_url":"https://www.snap.com/monetization-terms?lang=en-US","publisher":"Snap Inc. (snap.com legal terms)","verified_at":"2026-09-26","effective_date":"2025-02-01","changed_after":null,"changed_before":null,"date_note":null,"requires_user_confirmation":true,"supersedes":null,"applies_to":"not_applicable","requirement_phase":"not_applicable","mvp_scope":"in_scope","related_rule_ids":["ump.age_min_help_page"],"notes":"Supplementary note referenced from ump.age_min_help_page ('where applicable'). Not an equal alternative to the primary requirement of 18 or the local age of majority. Requires user confirmation because majority age and parental-consent rules depend on jurisdiction."},{"label":"FACT","rule_id":"ump.comply_terms_policy","version":1,"program":"unified_monetization_program","claim":"Comply with the Monetization Terms and the Creator Monetization Policy.","value":true,"unit":"boolean","metric":null,"operator":null,"window_days":null,"rule_type":"eligibility_condition","status":"current","source_url":"https://help.snapchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/14669003687444-About-Snapchat-s-Monetization-Program","publisher":"Snap Inc. (Snapchat Support)","verified_at":"2026-09-26","effective_date":null,"effective_date_note":"not published by Snap","changed_after":null,"changed_before":null,"date_note":null,"requires_user_confirmation":true,"supersedes":null,"applies_to":"all","requirement_phase":"entry_and_ongoing","mvp_scope":"in_scope","related_rule_ids":[],"notes":"Qualitative; cannot be checked from metrics."},{"label":"FACT","rule_id":"ump.country_eligible","version":1,"program":"unified_monetization_program","claim":"Creator must reside in an eligible country. Countries listed for 'Snapchat Monetization Program Ads within Stories and Spotlights' payouts.","value":["Algeria","Argentina","Australia","Austria","Bahrain","Belgium","Brazil","Canada","Colombia","Denmark","Egypt","Finland","France","Germany","India","Indonesia","Ireland","Italy","Jordan","Korea (the Republic of)","Kuwait","Lebanon","Libya","Malaysia","Mexico","Morocco","Netherlands (the)","New Zealand","Nigeria","Norway","Oman","Pakistan","Palestine","Philippines (the)","Poland","Qatar","Saudi Arabia","Singapore","Spain","Sweden","United Arab Emirates","United Kingdom","United States"],"unit":"country_names","metric":"country","operator":"in","window_days":null,"rule_type":"eligibility_threshold","status":"current","source_url":"https://help.snapchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/7012309512724-What-are-Creator-Rewards-and-how-can-I-earn-them","publisher":"Snap Inc. (Snapchat Support)","verified_at":"2026-09-26","effective_date":null,"effective_date_note":"not published by Snap","changed_after":null,"changed_before":null,"date_note":null,"iso_countries":[{"snap_name":"Algeria","alpha2":"DZ","alpha3":"DZA","numeric":"012"},{"snap_name":"Argentina","alpha2":"AR","alpha3":"ARG","numeric":"032"},{"snap_name":"Australia","alpha2":"AU","alpha3":"AUS","numeric":"036"},{"snap_name":"Austria","alpha2":"AT","alpha3":"AUT","numeric":"040"},{"snap_name":"Bahrain","alpha2":"BH","alpha3":"BHR","numeric":"048"},{"snap_name":"Belgium","alpha2":"BE","alpha3":"BEL","numeric":"056"},{"snap_name":"Brazil","alpha2":"BR","alpha3":"BRA","numeric":"076"},{"snap_name":"Canada","alpha2":"CA","alpha3":"CAN","numeric":"124"},{"snap_name":"Colombia","alpha2":"CO","alpha3":"COL","numeric":"170"},{"snap_name":"Denmark","alpha2":"DK","alpha3":"DNK","numeric":"208"},{"snap_name":"Egypt","alpha2":"EG","alpha3":"EGY","numeric":"818"},{"snap_name":"Finland","alpha2":"FI","alpha3":"FIN","numeric":"246"},{"snap_name":"France","alpha2":"FR","alpha3":"FRA","numeric":"250"},{"snap_name":"Germany","alpha2":"DE","alpha3":"DEU","numeric":"276"},{"snap_name":"India","alpha2":"IN","alpha3":"IND","numeric":"356"},{"snap_name":"Indonesia","alpha2":"ID","alpha3":"IDN","numeric":"360"},{"snap_name":"Ireland","alpha2":"IE","alpha3":"IRL","numeric":"372"},{"snap_name":"Italy","alpha2":"IT","alpha3":"ITA","numeric":"380"},{"snap_name":"Jordan","alpha2":"JO","alpha3":"JOR","numeric":"400"},{"snap_name":"Korea (the Republic of)","alpha2":"KR","alpha3":"KOR","numeric":"410"},{"snap_name":"Kuwait","alpha2":"KW","alpha3":"KWT","numeric":"414"},{"snap_name":"Lebanon","alpha2":"LB","alpha3":"LBN","numeric":"422"},{"snap_name":"Libya","alpha2":"LY","alpha3":"LBY","numeric":"434"},{"snap_name":"Malaysia","alpha2":"MY","alpha3":"MYS","numeric":"458"},{"snap_name":"Mexico","alpha2":"MX","alpha3":"MEX","numeric":"484"},{"snap_name":"Morocco","alpha2":"MA","alpha3":"MAR","numeric":"504"},{"snap_name":"Netherlands (the)","alpha2":"NL","alpha3":"NLD","numeric":"528"},{"snap_name":"New Zealand","alpha2":"NZ","alpha3":"NZL","numeric":"554"},{"snap_name":"Nigeria","alpha2":"NG","alpha3":"NGA","numeric":"566"},{"snap_name":"Norway","alpha2":"NO","alpha3":"NOR","numeric":"578"},{"snap_name":"Oman","alpha2":"OM","alpha3":"OMN","numeric":"512"},{"snap_name":"Pakistan","alpha2":"PK","alpha3":"PAK","numeric":"586"},{"snap_name":"Palestine","alpha2":"PS","alpha3":"PSE","numeric":"275"},{"snap_name":"Philippines (the)","alpha2":"PH","alpha3":"PHL","numeric":"608"},{"snap_name":"Poland","alpha2":"PL","alpha3":"POL","numeric":"616"},{"snap_name":"Qatar","alpha2":"QA","alpha3":"QAT","numeric":"634"},{"snap_name":"Saudi Arabia","alpha2":"SA","alpha3":"SAU","numeric":"682"},{"snap_name":"Singapore","alpha2":"SG","alpha3":"SGP","numeric":"702"},{"snap_name":"Spain","alpha2":"ES","alpha3":"ESP","numeric":"724"},{"snap_name":"Sweden","alpha2":"SE","alpha3":"SWE","numeric":"752"},{"snap_name":"United Arab Emirates","alpha2":"AE","alpha3":"ARE","numeric":"784"},{"snap_name":"United Kingdom","alpha2":"GB","alpha3":"GBR","numeric":"826"},{"snap_name":"United States","alpha2":"US","alpha3":"USA","numeric":"840"}],"requires_user_confirmation":false,"supersedes":null,"applies_to":"entry","requirement_phase":"entry","mvp_scope":"in_scope","related_rule_ids":[],"notes":"43 countries. Identical list appears on the payout-countries help article under the older label 'Creator Midroll Ads within Stories'. The Creator Rewards FAQ (5909152630420) shows a shorter, older-looking generic list (37 countries; missing Colombia, Lebanon, Malaysia, Pakistan, Poland, Spain) — treated as stale; flagged for operator review. Monetization Terms say the Eligible Regions list is in the 'Creator Rewards Guidelines', which we could not locate as a standalone page. Engine must map ISO codes to these names in a reviewed lookup table."},{"label":"FACT","rule_id":"ump.excluded_parties","version":1,"program":"unified_monetization_program","claim":"Snap employees/officers/directors (and of its affiliates), government entities and their affiliates, and members of a royal family are not eligible.","value":true,"unit":"boolean","metric":null,"operator":null,"window_days":null,"rule_type":"eligibility_condition","status":"current","source_url":"https://www.snap.com/monetization-terms?lang=en-US","publisher":"Snap Inc. (snap.com legal terms)","verified_at":"2026-09-26","effective_date":"2025-02-01","changed_after":null,"changed_before":null,"date_note":null,"requires_user_confirmation":true,"supersedes":null,"applies_to":"entry","requirement_phase":"entry","mvp_scope":"in_scope","related_rule_ids":[],"notes":"Self-attested condition."},{"label":"FACT","rule_id":"ump.followers_min","version":1,"program":"unified_monetization_program","claim":"Creators may be eligible for invitation if they have at least 50,000 followers.","value":50000,"unit":"followers","metric":"followers","operator":"gte","window_days":null,"rule_type":"eligibility_threshold","status":"current","source_url":"https://help.snapchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/14669003687444-About-Snapchat-s-Monetization-Program","publisher":"Snap Inc. (Snapchat Support)","verified_at":"2026-09-26","effective_date":null,"effective_date_note":"not published by Snap","changed_after":null,"changed_before":null,"date_note":null,"requires_user_confirmation":false,"supersedes":null,"applies_to":"entry","requirement_phase":"entry","mvp_scope":"in_scope","related_rule_ids":[],"notes":"Effective date not stated on the source page. Same 50,000 figure also appeared in the Dec 16, 2024 newsroom announcement."},{"label":"FACT","rule_id":"ump.invalid_activity_excluded","version":1,"program":"unified_monetization_program","claim":"Snap may exclude activity that artificially inflates views or engagement (bots, click farms, paid inducements, view trading) from Qualifying Activity and payments.","value":true,"unit":"boolean","metric":null,"operator":null,"window_days":null,"rule_type":"content_policy","status":"current","source_url":"https://www.snap.com/monetization-terms?lang=en-US","publisher":"Snap Inc. (snap.com legal terms)","verified_at":"2026-09-26","effective_date":"2025-02-01","changed_after":null,"changed_before":null,"date_note":null,"requires_user_confirmation":true,"supersedes":null,"applies_to":"enrolled_creators","requirement_phase":"ongoing","mvp_scope":"in_scope","related_rule_ids":[],"notes":"Qualitative."},{"label":"FACT","rule_id":"ump.invitation_only","version":1,"program":"unified_monetization_program","claim":"The Monetization Program is open by invitation only; meeting the criteria does not guarantee an invitation. Snap notifies invited creators by email.","value":true,"unit":"boolean","metric":null,"operator":null,"window_days":null,"rule_type":"program_fact","status":"current","source_url":"https://www.snap.com/monetization-terms?lang=en-US","publisher":"Snap Inc. (snap.com legal terms)","verified_at":"2026-09-26","effective_date":"2025-02-01","changed_after":null,"changed_before":null,"date_note":null,"requires_user_confirmation":true,"supersedes":null,"applies_to":"entry","requirement_phase":"entry","mvp_scope":"in_scope","related_rule_ids":[],"notes":"Effective date is the Monetization Terms effective date (February 1, 2025). Invitation cannot be computed from metrics; engine must report it as requires_user_confirmation. Help page also states Snap does not charge fees for invitation and no third party controls eligibility."},{"label":"FACT","rule_id":"ump.no_invitation_fee","version":1,"program":"unified_monetization_program","claim":"Snap does not charge any fees or accept payment of any kind in exchange for invitation to the Monetization Program.","value":true,"unit":"boolean","metric":null,"operator":null,"window_days":null,"rule_type":"program_fact","status":"current","source_url":"https://help.snapchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/14669003687444-About-Snapchat-s-Monetization-Program","publisher":"Snap Inc. (Snapchat Support)","verified_at":"2026-09-28","effective_date":null,"effective_date_note":"not published by Snap","changed_after":null,"changed_before":null,"date_note":null,"requires_user_confirmation":false,"supersedes":null,"applies_to":"all","requirement_phase":"not_applicable","mvp_scope":"in_scope","related_rule_ids":["ump.invitation_only"],"notes":"Useful for scam warnings. Stated on Snap's Monetization Program help page."},{"label":"FACT","rule_id":"ump.no_third_party_controls_eligibility","version":1,"program":"unified_monetization_program","claim":"No third party controls eligibility to the Monetization Program.","value":true,"unit":"boolean","metric":null,"operator":null,"window_days":null,"rule_type":"program_fact","status":"current","source_url":"https://help.snapchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/14669003687444-About-Snapchat-s-Monetization-Program","publisher":"Snap Inc. (Snapchat Support)","verified_at":"2026-09-28","effective_date":null,"effective_date_note":"not published by Snap","changed_after":null,"changed_before":null,"date_note":null,"requires_user_confirmation":false,"supersedes":null,"applies_to":"all","requirement_phase":"not_applicable","mvp_scope":"in_scope","related_rule_ids":["ump.invitation_only"],"notes":"Useful for scam warnings. The same help page says a third party offering an invitation for payment “is not affiliated with, or authorized to act on behalf of Snap, in any way.”"},{"label":"FACT","rule_id":"ump.non_us_physical_location","version":1,"program":"unified_monetization_program","claim":"If you reside outside the United States, you (and any collaborator/contributor/administrator posting from your account) must be physically located outside the United States and within an Eligible Region when performing Qualifying Activity.","value":true,"unit":"boolean","metric":null,"operator":null,"window_days":null,"rule_type":"eligibility_condition","status":"current","source_url":"https://www.snap.com/monetization-terms?lang=en-US","publisher":"Snap Inc. (snap.com legal terms)","verified_at":"2026-09-26","effective_date":"2025-02-01","changed_after":null,"changed_before":null,"date_note":null,"requires_user_confirmation":true,"supersedes":null,"applies_to":"enrolled_creators","requirement_phase":"ongoing","mvp_scope":"in_scope","related_rule_ids":[],"notes":"Cannot be checked from metrics."},{"label":"FACT","rule_id":"ump.ongoing_spotlight_view_time_hours_28d_max_rewards","version":2,"program":"unified_monetization_program","claim":"Beginning May 7, 2026, creators already enrolled in the Monetization Program must maintain at least 100 hours of Total Spotlight View Time on their posts over the last 28 days to qualify for maximum Creator Rewards (tracked under 'Daily Rewards Eligibility' in Insights).","value":100,"unit":"hours","metric":"spotlight_view_time_hours_28d","operator":"gte","window_days":28,"rule_type":"ongoing_condition","status":"current","source_url":"https://help.snapchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/14669003687444-About-Snapchat-s-Monetization-Program","publisher":"Snap Inc. (Snapchat Support)","verified_at":"2026-09-26","effective_date":"2026-05-07","changed_after":null,"changed_before":null,"date_note":null,"requires_user_confirmation":false,"supersedes":"ump.ongoing_spotlight_view_time_hours_28d_max_rewards@1","applies_to":"enrolled_creators","requirement_phase":"ongoing","mvp_scope":"in_scope","related_rule_ids":[],"notes":"Ongoing requirement for creators already enrolled in the Monetization Program; not an entry (invitation) requirement. The help article on tracking it says it 'applies to users currently enrolled in Snapchat's Ads Monetization Program.' Snap's wording is 'to qualify for maximum Creator Rewards'. Snap does not say what happens below 100 hours, so we must not state or imply that rewards stop. Also confirmed on help article 47748552848660."},{"label":"FACT","rule_id":"ump.original_advertiser_friendly_content","version":1,"program":"unified_monetization_program","claim":"Publish original, advertiser-friendly content compliant with Community Guidelines and Content Guidelines for Recommendation Eligibility.","value":true,"unit":"boolean","metric":null,"operator":null,"window_days":null,"rule_type":"eligibility_condition","status":"current","source_url":"https://help.snapchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/14669003687444-About-Snapchat-s-Monetization-Program","publisher":"Snap Inc. (Snapchat Support)","verified_at":"2026-09-26","effective_date":null,"effective_date_note":"not published by Snap","changed_after":null,"changed_before":null,"date_note":null,"requires_user_confirmation":true,"supersedes":null,"applies_to":"entry","requirement_phase":"entry","mvp_scope":"in_scope","related_rule_ids":[],"notes":"Qualitative; cannot be checked from metrics."},{"label":"FACT","rule_id":"ump.payment_formula_proprietary","version":1,"program":"unified_monetization_program","claim":"Payment amounts are determined by Snap's proprietary formula, which may consider post frequency and timing, number of ads distributed, use of Snapchat Creative Tools, and user engagement; in-app amounts are estimates.","value":"proprietary formula","unit":"text","metric":null,"operator":null,"window_days":null,"rule_type":"payout_term","status":"current","source_url":"https://www.snap.com/monetization-terms?lang=en-US","publisher":"Snap Inc. (snap.com legal terms)","verified_at":"2026-09-26","effective_date":"2025-02-01","changed_after":null,"changed_before":null,"date_note":null,"requires_user_confirmation":false,"supersedes":null,"applies_to":"enrolled_creators","requirement_phase":"not_applicable","mvp_scope":"in_scope","related_rule_ids":[],"notes":"No public rate per view/hour exists in Snap's own sources. Engines must not estimate earnings."},{"label":"FACT","rule_id":"ump.revenue_source","version":1,"program":"unified_monetization_program","claim":"Snapchat places ads between Snaps in a Public Story or within a Spotlight, and creators in the program receive a share of revenue. Ads are served primarily based on time spent watching Stories and Spotlights.","value":"share of ad revenue from ads in Public Stories and Spotlight","unit":"text","metric":null,"operator":null,"window_days":null,"rule_type":"program_fact","status":"current","source_url":"https://help.snapchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/14669003687444-About-Snapchat-s-Monetization-Program","publisher":"Snap Inc. (Snapchat Support)","verified_at":"2026-09-26","effective_date":null,"effective_date_note":"not published by Snap","changed_after":null,"changed_before":null,"date_note":null,"requires_user_confirmation":false,"supersedes":null,"applies_to":"all","requirement_phase":"not_applicable","mvp_scope":"in_scope","related_rule_ids":[],"notes":"Snap does not publish a revenue-share percentage or rate; payment amounts use a proprietary formula (Monetization Terms §3). Never state a rate."},{"label":"FACT","rule_id":"ump.snap_star_required","version":1,"program":"unified_monetization_program","claim":"Creator must be a Snap Star to be eligible for invitation.","value":true,"unit":"boolean","metric":"is_snap_star","operator":"is_true","window_days":null,"rule_type":"eligibility_condition","status":"current","source_url":"https://help.snapchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/14669003687444-About-Snapchat-s-Monetization-Program","publisher":"Snap Inc. (Snapchat Support)","verified_at":"2026-09-26","effective_date":null,"effective_date_note":"not published by Snap","changed_after":null,"changed_before":null,"date_note":null,"requires_user_confirmation":true,"supersedes":null,"applies_to":"entry","requirement_phase":"entry","mvp_scope":"in_scope","related_rule_ids":[],"notes":"Snap Star status is granted by Snap after application; a user may self-report it, but we cannot verify it. Treated as requires_user_confirmation."},{"label":"FACT","rule_id":"ump.spotlight_min_video_length_seconds","version":2,"program":"unified_monetization_program","claim":"For Spotlight videos to be eligible to earn revenue, they must be at least 30 seconds long.","value":30,"unit":"seconds","metric":"spotlight_video_length_seconds","operator":"gte","window_days":null,"rule_type":"eligibility_threshold","status":"current","source_url":"https://help.snapchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/14669003687444-About-Snapchat-s-Monetization-Program","publisher":"Snap Inc. (Snapchat Support)","verified_at":"2026-09-26","effective_date":null,"effective_date_note":"not published by Snap","changed_after":"2026-07-23","changed_before":"2026-07-31","date_note":"per archived Snap help page (Wayback Machine snapshots of support article 14669003687444 on 2026-07-23 and 2026-07-31); not announced by Snap.","requires_user_confirmation":false,"supersedes":"ump.spotlight_min_video_length_seconds@1","applies_to":"entry","requirement_phase":"entry","mvp_scope":"in_scope","related_rule_ids":[],"notes":"Per-video condition, not an account eligibility criterion. Effective date not stated. Supersedes the Dec 2024 announcement that Spotlight videos 'longer than 1 minute' could be monetized (ump.spotlight_min_video_length_2024). Classified as an entry-type rule per the operator's 2026-09-26 fix; it is a per-video condition, so v1 calculators list it as a FACT and do not evaluate it. Changed between July 23 and July 31, 2026 (archived captures of Snap's help page; not announced by Snap). The 2026-07-23 capture still says Spotlight videos must be at least 1 minute long. The 2026-07-31 capture says they must be at least 30 seconds long."},{"label":"FACT","rule_id":"ump.spotlight_view_time_hours_28d_min","version":2,"program":"unified_monetization_program","claim":"At least 3,000 of the 15,000 hours of view time over the last 28 days must come from Spotlight.","value":3000,"unit":"hours","metric":"spotlight_view_time_hours_28d","operator":"gte","window_days":28,"rule_type":"eligibility_threshold","status":"current","source_url":"https://help.snapchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/14669003687444-About-Snapchat-s-Monetization-Program","publisher":"Snap Inc. (Snapchat Support)","verified_at":"2026-09-27","effective_date":null,"effective_date_note":"not published by Snap","changed_after":"2026-02-16","changed_before":"2026-02-17","date_note":"per archived Snap help page (Wayback Machine snapshots of support article 14669003687444 on 2026-02-16 and 2026-02-17); not announced by Snap.","requires_user_confirmation":false,"supersedes":"ump.spotlight_view_time_hours_28d_min@1","applies_to":"entry","requirement_phase":"entry","mvp_scope":"in_scope","related_rule_ids":["ump.view_time_hours_28d_min"],"notes":"Entry (invitation) criterion from the same help-page edit as the 15,000-hour view-time rule. Changed between Feb 16 and Feb 17, 2026 (archived captures of Snap's help page; not announced by Snap). Distinct from the 100-hour ongoing threshold for already-enrolled creators (ump.ongoing_spotlight_view_time_hours_28d_max_rewards)."},{"label":"FACT","rule_id":"ump.view_time_hours_28d_min","version":2,"program":"unified_monetization_program","claim":"Achieve 15,000 hours of view time over the last 28 days.","value":15000,"unit":"hours","metric":"view_time_hours_28d","operator":"gte","window_days":28,"rule_type":"eligibility_threshold","status":"current","source_url":"https://help.snapchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/14669003687444-About-Snapchat-s-Monetization-Program","publisher":"Snap Inc. (Snapchat Support)","verified_at":"2026-09-27","effective_date":null,"effective_date_note":"not published by Snap","changed_after":"2026-02-16","changed_before":"2026-02-17","date_note":"per archived Snap help page (Wayback Machine snapshots of support article 14669003687444 on 2026-02-16 and 2026-02-17); not announced by Snap.","requires_user_confirmation":false,"supersedes":"ump.view_time_hours_28d_min@1","applies_to":"entry","requirement_phase":"entry","mvp_scope":"in_scope","related_rule_ids":["ump.view_metric_any_of_2024"],"notes":"Changed between Feb 16 and Feb 17, 2026 (archived captures of Snap's help page; not announced by Snap). Prior rule ump.view_metric_any_of_2024: one of 10 million Snap views, 1 million Spotlight views, or 12,000 hours of view time in the last 28 days. Source: Snap Newsroom, \"Snapchat Introduces New, Unified Monetization Program for Creators\", Dec 16, 2024, https://newsroom.snap.com/snapchat-new-creator-monetization, verified 2026-09-27. Whether the 15,000 hours count Stories and Spotlight combined is implied ('of those hours coming from Spotlight') but not defined on the page."}],"country_eligibility":[{"program":"unified_monetization_program","country":"US","listed":true,"rule_id":"ump.country_eligible"}]}}}},"GetRuleChangesOK":{"description":"Rule change FACTs.","headers":{"RateLimi