 Spotlight combined is implied ('of those hours coming from Spotlight') but not defined on the page.","snap_effective_date":null,"snap_announced_date":null,"first_recorded_by_us":"2026-09-27","evidence_urls":["https://help.snapchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/14669003687444-About-Snapchat-s-Monetization-Program","https://web.archive.org/web/20260216031923id_/https://help.snapchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/14669003687444","https://web.archive.org/web/20260217204230id_/https://help.snapchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/14669003687444"],"date_confidence":"bounded_by_archives","date_display":"Between Feb 16 and Feb 17, 2026 (archived captures, links). First recorded by us: 2026-09-27. https://help.snapchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/14669003687444-About-Snapchat-s-Monetization-Program https://web.archive.org/web/20260216031923id_/https://help.snapchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/14669003687444 https://web.archive.org/web/20260217204230id_/https://help.snapchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/14669003687444"},{"label":"FACT","rule_id":"ump.ongoing_spotlight_view_time_hours_28d_max_rewards","program":"unified_monetization_program","change_type":"added","previous":null,"current":{"version":1,"value":100,"unit":"hours","status":"current","verified_at":"2026-09-26","claim":"Beginning May 7, 2026, creators already enrolled in the Monetization Program must maintain at least 100 hours of Total Spotlight View Time on their posts over the last 28 days to qualify for maximum Creator Rewards (tracked under 'Daily Rewards Eligibility' in Insights)."},"source_url":"https://help.snapchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/14669003687444-About-Snapchat-s-Monetization-Program","detected_at":"2026-09-26","effective_date":"2026-05-07","changed_after":null,"changed_before":null,"date_note":null,"effective_month":null,"notes":"Ongoing requirement for creators already enrolled in the Monetization Program; not an entry (invitation) requirement. The help article on tracking it says it 'applies to users currently enrolled in Snapchat's Ads Monetization Program.' Snap's wording is 'to qualify for maximum Creator Rewards'. Snap does not say what happens below 100 hours, so we must not state or imply that rewards stop. Also confirmed on help article 47748552848660.","snap_effective_date":"2026-05-07","snap_announced_date":null,"first_recorded_by_us":"2026-09-26","evidence_urls":["https://help.snapchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/14669003687444-About-Snapchat-s-Monetization-Program","https://help.snapchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/47748552848660-How-do-I-track-my-100-Hours-of-Spotlight-View-Time-Last-28-days"],"date_confidence":"stated_by_snap","date_display":"Snap's date: May 7, 2026. First recorded by us: 2026-09-26. https://help.snapchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/14669003687444-About-Snapchat-s-Monetization-Program https://help.snapchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/47748552848660-How-do-I-track-my-100-Hours-of-Spotlight-View-Time-Last-28-days"},{"label":"FACT","rule_id":"recommendation_eligibility.wholly_ai_generated_spotlight","program":"recommendation_eligibility","change_type":"added","previous":null,"current":{"version":1,"value":true,"unit":"boolean","status":"current","verified_at":"2026-09-26","claim":"As of July 2026, wholly AI-generated videos are no longer eligible for recommendation on Spotlight; content enhanced or edited with Snapchat's own AI tools remains eligible."},"source_url":"https://newsroom.snap.com/rewarding-authentic-creativity-on-spotlight","detected_at":"2026-09-26","effective_date":null,"effective_date_note":"not published by Snap","changed_after":null,"changed_before":null,"date_note":"Newsroom post dated 2026-07-31. Snap states July 2026 ('as of this month') and does not state an effective day.","effective_month":"2026-07","notes":"Announcement dated July 31, 2026 says 'As of this month' (i.e., July 2026); exact day not stated, so effective_date is null. Quality guideline page says ranking 'rewards authentic, human-made content over wholly AI-generated content created outside of Snapchat'.","snap_e